repository-code: "https://github.com/ICONgroupCWC/Gazebo-Sionna-RT-Integration"

abstract: >
  This repository provides an integration framework for Gazebo and
  Sionna RT for joint robotic and wireless simulation. It includes
  Gazebo world models, corresponding Sionna RT XML scene models,
  and the ROS-based integration required to synchronize the robotic
  simulation with wireless channel generation.

keywords:

  - Gazebo
  - Sionna RT
  - ROS
  - Wireless Simulation
  - Ray Tracing
  - Robotics
  - Wireless Channels
  - Digital Twin

